OL,3,GNEWSATown to host Tour of Britain Women
OL,4,Afinal stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people are expected to turn
OL,7,Fout to cheer on the cyclists as they
OL,8,Fcross the finish line at the Tour of
OL,9,FBritain Women 2026.
OL,11,FThe final stage of the event, which
OL,12,Ffeatures 114 riders representing 19
OL,13,Fteams and 24 nations, will take place
OL,14,Fin and around Leamington Spa in
OL,15,FWarwickshire on Sunday.
OL,17,FThe race began in Cockermouth, Cumbria,
OL,18,Fon Wednesday and subsequent stages have
OL,19,Fbeen hosted in Lancashire and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
